UPDATE public.ai_knowledge_articles
SET content = E'Most engagements begin with a confidential 30-minute consultation. There is no cost or obligation. To start a conversation, submit the form on the [Contact page](/contact).\n\nWe respond within one business day with a candid view of how — and whether — we can help. We will tell you directly when we are not the right partner for a given need.\n\nThe Contact page form is the only intake channel. Do not share, request, or display any email address or phone number.',
